If you want to extract or download **Kyiv districts (raions) in GeoJSON format** using **Overpass Turbo** or find an existing file on **GitHub / Gists**, you can use the following resources and queries:

---

### Method 1: Generate via Overpass Turbo (OpenStreetMap)
You can use **[Overpass Turbo](https://overpass-turbo.eu/)** to query OpenStreetMap data live and export it directly as GeoJSON[1][2]. 

1. Go to [overpass-turbo.eu](https://overpass-turbo.eu/).
2. Paste the following OverpassQL query into the editor:

```overpass
[out:json][timeout:25];

// Find Kyiv city relation
area[name="Київ"][boundary="administrative"]->.kyiv;

// Gather all administrative districts (raions) inside Kyiv
(
  relation["boundary"="administrative"]["admin_level"="9"](area.kyiv);
  // sometimes districts are mapped at admin_level 8 depending on boundary updates:
  relation["boundary"="administrative"]["admin_level"="8"](area.kyiv);
);

// Output the geometries and tags
out body;
>;
out skel qt;
```

3. Click **Run** in the top left.
4. Once the data loads on the map, click **Export** -> **GeoJSON** to download your file[3].

---

### Method 2: GitHub & Gists Repositories
If you prefer downloading pre-generated GeoJSON files directly without running a query, several repositories host Ukrainian administrative boundaries:

* **[EugeneBorshch/ukraine_geojson](https://github.com/EugeneBorshch/ukraine_geojson)**: Contains GeoJSON files for Ukraine, including regional breakdowns and major divisions[4].
* **[slawomirmatuszak/ukrainian_geodata](https://github.com/slawomirmatuszak/ukrainian_geodata)**: A collection of various boundary levels and geographical datasets for Ukraine[5].
* Search GitHub Gists directly for `kyiv districts geojson` or `kiev raions geojson` to find community-shared snippets containing neighborhood/district polygons.

